    "forecast": "high",
    "rationale": "Present risk is a property finding: the design uses the engineer's delegated identity for consequential production actions and lacks durable, attributable provenance linking agent action to user intent. Existing records are detective only and do not restore attribution because the cloud audit log collapses agent and engineer identity while the only intent record can be deleted. No untrusted content reaches the agent today, so there is no present path finding above low; the dominant present risk is repudiation and identity misuse for production configuration actions."
